  "title": "Dutch Cookies",
  "description": "This recipe has become a cherished family favorite, and it all began in 1965 with my older brother&#39;s 2nd grade teacher sharing it with our mother. Melt-in-your-mouth good! At holiday time, add festive sprinkles on top while chocolate is still soft. Enjoy!",
  "authors": [
